    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a subject I've found both challenging and rewarding. As someone who enjoys problem-solving, I appreciate its logical structure and precision. While it can be demanding, especially when dealing with abstract concepts like calculus or algebra, I find satisfaction in understanding complex problems step by step. It's not just about memorizing formulas; it's about seeing how different pieces fit together to solve real-world issues.",
